#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Benediction: a second game for the Blobber engine.

The far future.  For nine hundred years the cathedral-ship Benediction was
lost in the deep void with the body and relics of Saint Orsolya of the
Burning Hand aboard.  Now it has drifted back into the light of the
Imperium of Terra, and something has made a nest in it.  A squad of the
Order of the Iron Vigil, loyal servants of the Holy Emperor, docks the
strike ship Unbending Vow against the wreck: cleanse it of the alien
Brood, and bring the Saint's relics home.

Run it with ./benediction (Python 3 with Tk, nothing else).  The game is
saved to ~/.benediction.json.  ./benediction --selftest checks the maps,
and --balance plays its fights with a simulated player.
"""

